@PetApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5227
### 1. Create
POST {{PetApi_HostAddress}}/api/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rex",
  "isAdopted": false
}

### 2. Get all
GET {{PetApi_HostAddress}}/api/pets

### 3. Get one
GET {{PetApi_HostAddress}}/api/pets/1

### 4. Update (expect 204)
PUT {{PetApi_HostAddress}}/api/pets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Rex the Great",
  "isAdopted": true
}

### 5. Delete (expect 204)
DELETE {{PetApi_HostAddress}}/api/pets/1